  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Omani Human Rights Commission Study visit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this government-to-government (G2G) project is to support the Omani Human Rights Commission on how to restructure their institutional architecture. It specifically focusses on exchanging knowledge between peers, civil engagement regarding human rights violation complaints, and the translation of these complaints into law enforcement institutions.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
